[I] Keep imports out of your namespace

[T] namespace::autoclean removes imported functions from a package at the
[T] end of its compilation, while keeping the methods defined by the package
[T] and its overloads, so imports do not become methods.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/namespace-autoclean

